recommend check-in (Keaton) -- two. THE HALF I CANNOT REACH: three of %524's four firings arrive by rebase, invisible to any hook; the post-rebase re-verify is the one place they are visible while the package is still local, and it is six ships' send path, so I did not take it. THE PIER'S OWN CAPACITY: three ships ran full cold roster passes concurrently on four cores this hour and mine took 1,527s against a nominal 1,139; `--scoped` exists for this and the cold open does not reach for it.
